#~ msgstr "Ne?! Karakolu tutmalıyız! Ve Dacyn nereye gitti?!"

#~ msgid "Gweddry? Good! You are still alive. Quickly, we must leave this place!"
#~ msgstr "Gweddry? İyi! Hala hayattasın. Çabucak, burayı terk etmeliyiz!"

#~ msgid "Where did you go?! And where did you come from?"
#~ msgstr "Nereye gittin?! Ve nereden geldin?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This outpost is already lost. We must defeat this evil if Wesnoth is to "
#~ "survive. Now, come on, we do not have much time to spare!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Bu karakol zaten kaybedildi. Wesnoth'un hayatta kalması için bu kötülüğü "
#~ "yenmeliyiz. Hadi, çok zamanımız yok!"

#~ msgid "Move Gweddry to the trapdoor"
#~ msgstr "Gweddry'yi gizli kapağa taşı"

#~ msgid "Hurry! We cannot defeat this evil today! We must escape!"
#~ msgstr "Acele edin! Bu kötülüğü bugün yenemeyiz! Kaçmalıyız!"

#~ msgid "Follow me, men! Through the trapdoor!"
#~ msgstr "Beni takip edin, beyler! Gizli kapaktan!"

#~ msgid "Get moving quickly."
#~ msgstr "Çabucak hareket edin."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is an old escape route for the outpost. Unfortunately these caves are "
#~ "currently inhabited by trolls, who are blocking our path through the tunnel."
