#~ msgid ""
#~ "We cannot spend any more time attempting to defeat Mal-Skraat. Like it or "
#~ "not, we must go further into these undead lands."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mal-Skraat'ı yenmeye çalışarak daha fazla zaman harcayamayız. İster beğen "
